001487r 2               ; do_readlist — READLIST: read a line, return as a list
001487r 2               ;   Arity 0, no arguments. Reporter.
001487r 2               ;   Calls read_line, tokenize_line, then walks tokens building a list.
001487r 2               ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
001487r 2               do_readlist:
001487r 2                     ; Save tokenizer state (we'll overwrite tok_head/tok_tail)
001487r 2  A5 rr              LDA   tok_head_lo
